    "body": "\r\nThanks @annevk. [Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WHATWG#Transition_of_HTML_Publication_to_WHATWG) showed me good news,\r\n\r\n> On 28 May 2019, the W3C announced that WHATWG would be the sole publisher of the HTML and DOM standards. \r\n\r\nCongratulations!  Well,  only to confirm that is it: <br/> &nbsp; the *HTML5 standard*, in nowadays, is not W3C, is a WHATWG standard.\r\n\r\nPS:  I checked the FAQ, and it say nothing about it.",
